cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "qft-neural-operator: neural operators for the QFT action-to-observable map in Euclidean AdS2"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Erik
    family-names: Löffelholz
    email: eriklfholz@googlemail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/erik2810/qft-neural-operator"
abstract: >-
  A physics-informed neural operator framework learning the map from bulk interaction
  potentials V(phi) to boundary connected correlators in Euclidean AdS2. Combines a
  Fourier-DeepONet architecture carrying the AdS2 conformal factor in its positional
  encoding with boundary-scaling and Callan-Symanzik losses, and a hybrid data pipeline
  in which first-order anomalous dimensions are obtained either in closed form or from
  numerically integrated bulk contact diagrams.
keywords:
  - neural operator
  - DeepONet
  - Fourier neural operator
  - quantum field theory
  - AdS/CFT
  - holographic renormalization
  - Sine-Gordon
  - physics-informed machine learning
  - renormalization group
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-08-22"
